{"server":"cn","storyId":"act24side_level_act24side_05_end","groupId":"act24side","stageId":"act24side_05","title":"野蛮肇事者","storyCode":"CF-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"b82af6e546bd7feabc1e837d346e40a2ce91778c0b73414dbde7268b105b5169","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"众人再次与火龙作战，然而对其的攻击依旧效果甚微。夜刀为保护老猎人，承受了火龙的攻击，而黑角和学者猫则被火龙带上天空。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g5_redleaflake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇怪......这对双剑......应该能对火龙造成伤害，却没法再更进一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么会这样？是我的使用方法不对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角，掩护我！我再试一次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！啊，等等，俺的盾收起来了，这个刀该怎么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等——你！唉！俺来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"学者猫，对策想好没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，我在想喵！不要催我喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火龙的弱点，火龙的进攻方式，不是这里......我明明记得从“猎人笔记”中抄下来过的，到哪里去了喵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能不能行啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角，火龙朝你那边去了！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺举盾——俺盾呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阁下请往左闪开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太刀大开大合，须以气御刃，决胜于收放之间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这声音......是刚刚那个......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傻瓜黑角！它也是艾露猫，是随从艾露猫喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长角的异国“猎人”哦，老夫是有多年经验的随从艾露猫......喵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀，它又要喷火了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"学者猫，你看它的脑袋！这是艾露猫吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这身装备乃是老夫跟随多年的“猎人”赠予的，凝结了无数过往的狩猎回忆，是勇气与历练的象征......喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全没有感受到啊！还有学者猫，艾露猫为什么可以打架啊？你不是每次都在逃跑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角根本不懂喵！它是随从艾露猫，专门负责狩猎的喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随从们作为伙伴跟随“猎人”狩猎是一项古老的传统，不仅是艾露猫，据说在某些东方村落也会训练牙猎犬参与狩猎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在干什么啊？黑角！认真作战！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺知道！俺要想想，大开大合、大开大合......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊！俺会了！尝尝这招！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的有效果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好机会！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏生先生！你在做什么？为什么要推开我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我的猎物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们给我滚远点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀，火龙又来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物！瞧我这边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角，我有办法了喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笔记上写了，用近战武器的话，火龙的头部是最大的弱点，其次是翅膀和尾巴喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最关键的招式是火龙的甩尾！它会在观察方位后进行甩尾攻击，所以头部倾斜的方向就是它甩尾的方向喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲开后利用它大体型较长的调整时间吗？就是上次我和黑角试过的那样，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫不确定这样是否可行，这头火龙来到这里后有不少异常......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论如何总要试试，进攻交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺去吸引它甩尾，随从艾露猫，你比较灵活，等它甩尾的时候可以帮俺们干扰它一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫定尽力而为......喵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，柏生老爷子又冲上去了。学者猫去拦一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵？我该怎么办哇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺上了！嘿啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是甩尾的前兆喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（破绽......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是这里！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，不对劲......喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火龙竟然察觉到了夜刀的攻击......怎么可能喵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它甚至没有看到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它身边是......源石粉尘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀小心！它要喷火了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好......那一下如果挨上的话，我恐怕要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没听说过火龙怎么可以喷出这么恐怖的火焰啊喵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"类似的行为从来没有被记载过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀！它又冲向你那边了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，它的目标是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我有资格面对你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀！它不是直冲！它是要甩尾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你给我让开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——我不是让你滚远点吗？你为什么要过来？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用管我！去对付火龙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵！火龙冲我来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角！救我！喵喵喵喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！俺来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫也来了喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵呜！我躲开了！我抓住了！没事！我没事喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火龙，吃俺的招式！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"学者猫，你放手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不可以！我放手就会被火龙吃掉喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听俺的，放手！俺会接住你的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷！老夫没抓住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，学者猫，俺抓到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刀，啊，怎么回事——卡住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵！二位......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黑角！我们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊！俺们怎么在天上啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，该死，这火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就在这里干看着吗？想想办法把火龙打下来啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢货！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有闪光球，老夫想不到别的办法了......喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不可能，我可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再过去了喵！阁下闯不过去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点去安全的地方喵！老夫还有办法！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g5_redleaflake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"营地......正在燃烧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"装备都烧掉了喵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火龙......如果老夫的推测没错的话，它应该是返回了在此地的一处洞穴......喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洞穴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，自从老夫到达这里后，就一直跟踪火龙观察着它的行动，亲眼看到它出入一处洞穴......喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉见笑了，一直在努力改掉“喵”的口癖，但是或许是种族的缘故，“喵”实在无法停止......喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"言归正传。老夫可以带二位前去......喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下只有这一个办法，拜托你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏生先生，如果你想要再次与火龙战斗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只能和我们同行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
